msgstr "WCPOS Pro nepavyko įkelti. Paleiskite composer install."

msgid "WCPOS Pro"
msgstr "WCPOS Pro"

msgid ""
"now includes all features from the free plugin. The standalone free plugin "
"has been automatically deactivated. You may safely delete it from your "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"dabar apima visas nemokamo įskiepio funkcijas. Atskirai veikiantis "
"nemokamas įskiepis buvo automatiškai išjungtas. Galite saugiai jį ištrinti "
"iš savo įskiepių."

